  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere, Light sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you shapeshift a target, you may also cause that target to glow. In addition you may maintain concentration on the shapeshift and the bright light of the glow with a single action. If you apply a (light) talent to a glow created and maintained this way, it counts against the number of traits you may grant with your shapeshift.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc78\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
